{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. The player takes on the role of a bad handsome, and after rescuing Diao Chan from the Dark Moon organization, returns to the bad guard. Here, you can handle both experience and silver transactions.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/c9e068ea0bdd925b9cf5ecfe92c4830c.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Players have four categories: attributes, skills, equipment, and props.Click on the avatar in the upper right corner to view it<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/5496c197e58b3219affdc827d8349668.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Leave the bad guard and come to Zhuque Street to start the game of Jinyi Night Walk. You can click to challenge 2 types of enemies, defeat them to gain experience and silver coins<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/ed9e1a2129f8d91a45a782b0a60d1a6b.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.During the battle on Zhuque Street, you can use the Longquan Sword Technique to deal a large amount of damage to enemies.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/be423039da9e53c6db1cccdbc38f5c28.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. From Zhuque Street, you can come to Zhuque Gate and successfully challenge Xu Tongling for the first time. You can unlock the check-in system and receive a random reward by checking in once every 3 minutes in any scene. Subsequent challenges can still gain experience and silver coins<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/2ef386747ccfd4ec6e6e6f9d7a89cd8d.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6.From Zhuque Street, you can come to Qiuyue Tower and spend two taels of silver to interact with beautiful women, including dancing, accompanying, and staying overnight. Watching Diaochan dance during the performance can enhance one's impression. When accompanying, recite poetry with Diaochan. Answering correctly can enhance favorability, while answering incorrectly can reduce favorability. During the stay, you can watch Diao Chan's intimate behavior and gain experience every 5 seconds.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/extras/9264d7f6bde563b864ca55e0a83e8c6b.avif?t=1761973828\" width=1560 height=880 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128870?t=1761973828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4128870?t=1761973828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/c62ab980bcfa73b21b5fdb50827f72cc8f17da75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761973828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4128870/c62ab980bcfa73b21b5fdb50827f72cc8f17da75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761973828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"Some scenes in the game include adult only content such as revealing clothing \uff0c sexual innuendos \uff0cFrequent Nudity and sexual acts"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.